  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.24 Routine filings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.24 “Routine filings” means documents submitted, on a recurrent basis, by a utility to the commission, and as specified in Puc 203.10(a).\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
